LAG function:helps to access the data from previous row when we process the data for the current row
-compare the sales volume from this month to previous month to analyse the growth of business,
-by default it get the value from previous row change that to access the data from diff row using the "offset" parameter
-instead of sending the NULL we can set the "Default" parameter as the data 
-to get previous quarter sales volue LAG(volume) is used,
select company,year,quarter,volume,
LAG(volume)OVER(ORDER BY company,year,quarter)AS prev_vol
volume-LAG(volume)OVER(ORDER BY company,year,quarter)AS difference
FROM sales
WHERE company = 'Tesla'
-order the data based on company,year and quarter,it orders in ascending order of year and quarter
-sort the data based on year 20222 first then 2023
